tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111481","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111481.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111481.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-13T17:37:06Z"},"body":"- Helps address #111218 \r\n\r\nOne of the top contributors to compile time is `texture.h`, through its extraneous includes that lead to e.g. `rendering_server.h`, `os.h`, `engine.h`, and `camera_server.h`. \r\n\r\nAlmost all of them can be removed without trade-off, because `texture.h` wasn't actually using them.\r\nBy removing them, both the fresh compile cost should go down, as should recompile cost when changing in any areas related to the files above.\r\n\r\nThe main cascading changes are:\r\n\r\n- Adding explicit `rendering_server.h` includes to texture source files\r\n- Adding `gradient.h` includes to texture header files\r\n- Some random includes of other headers to source files.\r\n- A change to `display_server.h` which is required because of a shadowing warning in SCU builds.... (maybe we should disable shadowing warnings in SCU builds?)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111481/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111481/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}